        {
          "text": "Bhayö mbo Abhaisiraeri bhano bhaabharöë gököreng'aana na ichika chaabho, guisanchö na amakomo gaabho, bhonsui mbaarëngë ibhirara bhisansabha na ibhiköë bhitatö na amagana ataano na mërongo ëtaano (603,550). ",
          "type": "text",
